# Every service's Dockerfile is a thin "COPY a prebuilt jar" image (the real
# compile happens via `./gradlew build` on the host, not inside Docker) — so
# **/build/libs/*.jar must stay in context, it's the one thing every image
# actually needs. The rest of each module's build/ output (compiled classes,
# test-results, reports) is negligible in size and safe to exclude, but isn't
# the source of slow builds here — don't exclude build/ wholesale.

**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.iml
